# CODEOWNERS — AI Nutrition Coach v1
# Story 5.3 — pins the named-reviewer ownership on every path
# that touches user-facing copy.
#
# The named reviewer is documented in REVIEWERS.md at the repo
# root. Replace `@mmornati` with your own GitHub
# handle when forking the repo. The ndp-review gate reads the owner handles
# from this file generically (it requires each to be listed in REVIEWERS.md),
# so it needs no change when the handle is replaced.
#
# Format: <pattern>  <owner>
# Trailing `/` matches directories. `*` is a wildcard.

# ── Default owner (catches everything not explicitly pinned) ──
*  @mmornati

# ── Strings catalogue (every user-facing string lives here) ──
/apps/web/src/i18n/  @mmornati

# ── All user-facing components and screens ──
/apps/web/src/components/  @mmornati
/apps/web/src/screens/  @mmornati

# ── All docs (user-facing + contributor-facing) ──
/docs/  @mmornati

# ── No-Dark-Patterns Standard + release checklist ──
/docs/no-dark-patterns-standard.md  @mmornati
/docs/release-checklist.md  @mmornati
/docs/v2-managed-oversight.md  @mmornati
/docs/adults-only.md  @mmornati

# ── Build, release and supply-chain surface (anything that changes what
#    ships or what runs in CI is reviewed like code) ──
/infra/  @mmornati
/bin/  @mmornati
/scripts/  @mmornati
/tools/  @mmornati
/.github/  @mmornati
/SECURITY.md  @mmornati

# ── Reviewers file ──
/REVIEWERS.md  @mmornati

# ── Verification scripts (the gate itself) ──
/tools/check_release_posture.mjs  @mmornati
/tools/check_adults_only.mjs  @mmornati
/tools/check_telemetry_claims.mjs  @mmornati

# ── CI workflows that run the gate (also covered by /.github/ above) ──
/.github/workflows/  @mmornati
